      "review_description": "No onsite inspection prior to installation so first day was a failure due to inadequate space on planned roof and insufficient tilt brackets carried by installers.Second day and the installation was completed in 3 hours for a 3Kw system on a almost level roof and using tilt brackets - installers very professional.The free wireless home monitoring system is utter rubbish and an utter waste of time.Contractors are used for the installation process.Negotiated a reduced price for the tilt brackets as I regarded 'day 1 fiasco' to be their fault.All up $8000 for a 3Kw system October 2010I liken the whole quote process to being as 'enjoyable' as buying a second hand car!Caveat emptor!",
